<http://modellingdh.github.io/ont/odp/term/includes> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A relation of mereological nature that connects a given observation with the activity that originates them: it strengthens the argument that observations are always active processes from a cognitive standpoint, regardless of how conscious they may be. A standard mereological property from another content pattern may be used in lieu of this one and therefore aligned with it." .
